{'symbol': 'TXT', 'date': '2021-07-20 07:30:00', 'title': 'SURF AIR MOBILITY AND TEXTRON AVIATION ENTER INTO EXCLUSIVE RELATIONSHIP TO ELECTRIFY THE CESSNA GRAND CARAVAN', 'text': "LOS ANGELES--(BUSINESS WIRE)--SURF AIR MOBILITY INC., A COMPANY ACCELERATING THE ADOPTION OF ELECTRIC REGIONAL AIR TRAVEL, TODAY ANNOUNCED AN EXCLUSIVE RELATIONSHIP WITH TEXTRON AVIATION INC., A TEXTRON INC. (NYSE:TXT) COMPANY, SUPPORTING SURF AIR MOBILITY'S DEVELOPMENT OF ELECTRIFIED CESSNA GRAND CARAVAN AIRCRAFT, BEGINNING WITH A HYBRID ELECTRIC CESSNA GRAND CARAVAN AIRCRAFT, TARGETED TO BE AVAILABLE IN 2024. SURF AIR MOBILITY HAS AGREED TO PURCHASE UP TO 150 CESSNA GRAND CARAVAN EX SINGLE-EN"}